meSaid), date of birth (dobSaid), the test or collection date they mention (hintSaid), the answer to an identifier question (identifierSaid), their answer when results are offered (choiceSaid), or a second test or date they want afterwards (alsoSaid). Returns status NEED_NAME, NEED_DOB, NOT_FOUND, FOUND, NEED_ID, ID_FAILED, OFFER_ONE, OFFER, SELECTED, NO_MATCH_DATE, TOO_MANY, TOO_MANY_FINAL, NONE, OUT_OF_WINDOW, SENSITIVE or ALL_RESTRICTED, with say (words to use) and ask (what to ask next).","parameters":[{"name":"nameSaid","type":"string","required":false,"description":"The patient's name exactly as the caller said it, including any spelled letters; empty if not said this turn."},{"name":"dobSaid","type":"string","required":false,"description":"The patient's date of birth exactly as said, or the correction to it; empty if not said this turn."},{"name":"hintSaid","type":"string","required":false,"description":"The test name and/or collection date they mentioned, in their words; empty if none."},{"name":"identifierSaid","type":"string","required":false,"description":"Their answer to an identifier question (collection date, phone, address, state or email), as said; empty otherwise."},{"name":"choiceSaid","type":"string","required":false,"description":"Their answer when results were offered: yes, or which one they mean, as said; empty otherwise."},{"name":"alsoSaid","type":"string","required":false,"description":"A second test or date they want after this one, in their words; empty if none."},{"name":"rawWords","type":"string","required":false,"description":"The caller's last words, supplied automatically.","defaultSource":"runtime","visibility":{"model":false,"trace":false}},{"name":"today","type":"string","required":false,"description":"Today as YYYY-MM-DD, supplied automatically.","defaultSource":"runtime","visibility":{"model":false}},{"name":"acct8","type":"string","required":false,"description":"The authenticated account, supplied automatically.","defaultSource"